From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: annotate cohere2 graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

---
diff --git a/src/models/cohere2.cpp b/src/models/cohere2.cpp
index 251b2da62d05f1edfcc40ca089ebea922a3fae15..d5267bc05cb735bb8da39548054c46a4c1b1d23b 100644
--- a/src/models/cohere2.cpp
+++ b/src/models/cohere2.cpp
@@ -78,6 +78,8 @@ llama_model_cohere2::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) : llm_graph_c
     ggml_tensor * inp_out_ids = build_inp_out_ids();
 
     for (int il = 0; il < n_layer; ++il) {
+        begin_block(inpL, il);
+
         // UNUSED:
 
         // norm
@@ -130,6 +132,7 @@ llama_model_cohere2::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) : llm_graph_c
 
         // input for next layer
         inpL = cur;
+        end_block(inpL, il);
     }
 
     cur = inpL;
